<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro optimizes the Valkirye and warden MPX weapon for minimal recoil when using a telescopic sight at a resolution of 1920x1440 with a refresh rate of 165 Hz and an aspect ratio of 3:4. FOV of any width is recommended, except for 90, as well as the use of attachments: long barrel, straight handle, telescopic sight. Without the use of all required attachments, the return will be negative.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 10
Delay 3 ms
Delay 6 ms
Delay 9 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>